        "text": "You are watching a short social media video for a business.\nDescribe it in detail for a social media manager:\n- What happens, scene by scene\n- Food, products or services shown\n- People, setting, mood and colours\n- Any text on screen and anything spoken\nBe factual. Only describe what is actually in the video.",
